{
  "readme": "27 new board commodities: 6 cleaners (Household) + 21 pantry (spices/canned/vinegars). Bands are per-unit sanity gates. Regexes use word boundaries (see the bare-'air'-matches-'hair' lesson).",
  "category": {
    "Household": ["floor-cleaner","drain-cleaner","oven-cleaner","shower-cleaner","furniture-polish","insect-spray"],
